            "review_title": "Review at MaSa French Eatery by Hervé",
            "review_text": "GT2023\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nNice and relaxing\nJan 2024 • Couples\nIf you're looking for a delicious and elegant French tapas dining experience, look no further! \n\nWelcoming you in a very old style villa in the middle of Thao Dien, Masa French eatery offers offer a variety of dishes to satisfy your cravings. From tasty tapas up to the eggplant salad and Lamb main course, the mix was very nice. \n\nGood service. We were only 3 table that evening, which might be the only downside as am sure with more customers the place provide an even better vibes experience. \n\nBottom line : Nice and will return (now eager to soon go upstairs to try Chef Herve fine dining)\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2024",
